        "In 1988 I bought her a red Camaro with T-tops. Not because I wanted a flashy car. Because she loved Knight Rider. The black Trans Am that talked. Hasselhoff. The show ran from 1982 to 1986; she watched it through her late teens, fifteen into nineteen, the same years the first marriage was happening to her. She loved it anyway. So when I had a chance, at seventeen of mine, I bought the closest thing I could find to KITT in red. T-tops because she liked the open sky.",
